○ ob-3ko · Characterize the chunkwise WY recurrent-scan bottleneck   [● P1 · OPEN]
Type: task
Created: 2026-08-02 · Updated: 2026-08-02

DESCRIPTION

  Determine whether GDN cost is dominated by the inherently sequential state  
  update or by the chunk-parallel matmul portion, and how that balance shifts 
  between prefill and decode. This is the crux: a sequential scan and a dense 
  matmul want completely different engines, and the answer dictates the       
  mapping decision.                                                           



