○ ob-imb · DECISION (hard date 2026-08-09): Physical AI vs Edge AI track   [● P0 · OPEN]
Type: decision
Created: 2026-08-02 · Updated: 2026-08-02

DESCRIPTION

  Single most consequential scheduling decision. If the O6 has arrived and    
  booted, target Physical AI. If not, commit to Edge AI on the hedge target   
  and stop spending time on O6-specific work. NOTE (verified 2026-08-02): the 
  three tracks are Physical AI, Cloud AI, and Edge AI - there is no Mobile AI 
  track, correcting brief.md. Edge AI suits an O6 inference board well, so    
  both tracks stay open even with hardware in hand. Hard date so the write-up 
  has five clear days of stable framing. Done when the choice is recorded as  
  an ADR and the README framing follows it.                                   



